    reason: Missing output files: /data/scratch/DMP/UCEC/GENEVOD/qguo/Projects/lp_mut/results/sample1/Variants_Octopus_v0.5.2/sample1.octopus.filtered.vcf; Input files updated by another job: /data/scratch/DMP/UCEC/GENEVOD/qguo/Projects/lp_mut/results/sample1/Variants_Octopus_v0.5.2/sample1.octopus.vcf
    wildcards: sample=sample1
